        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Castlevania-belmont.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>In my office, I have a collage of Ordnance Survey maps plastered across my wall. They're from places I've lived - Derbyshire, East London, Bournemouth, Bristol - with cycle routes, country roads, and parks highlighted and circled. It's an atlas of my experiences, a living memoir of the places I've been and the things I've seen. There's magic in a map, its ability to remind you of the paths you've trodden and where you've yet to go.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/castlevania-belmonts-curse-review\">Read more</a></p>",
